sequenceDiagram
    participant SRC as Signal Source
    participant ING as Signal Ingestor
    participant WM as World Model
    participant RE as Risk Engine
    participant SC as Scenario Engine
    participant ORC as Orchestrator
    participant AGT as Specialist Agents (parallel)
    participant ADV as Adversary Agent
    participant CRD as Coordinator Agent
    participant SIM as Simulation Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant WS as WebSocket Hub
    participant FE as Frontend

    SRC->>ING: Raw signal event
    ING->>ING: Validate + classify signal
    ING->>WM: Validated signal
    WM->>WM: Update affected nodes/edges
    WM->>DB: Persist world state
    WM->>WS: world.update event
    WS-->>FE: world.update
    WM->>RE: World state snapshot
    RE->>RE: Compute multi-dimensional risk scores
    RE->>DB: Persist risk scores
    RE->>WS: risk.update event
    WS-->>FE: risk.update

    Note over SC: User triggers scenario creation
    RE->>SC: Risk-annotated world
    SC->>SC: Compose compound scenario
    SC->>DB: Persist scenario
    SC->>WS: scenario.created event
    WS-->>FE: scenario.created

    Note over ORC: User triggers agent run
    ORC->>WS: agent.started (x6)
    WS-->>FE: agent.started x6
    ORC->>AGT: dispatch(scenario, world) - asyncio.gather
    AGT->>AGT: AI generate proposal
    AGT->>AGT: Pydantic validate
    AGT->>SIM: Check feasibility
    SIM-->>AGT: sim result
    AGT-->>ORC: AgentProposal x6
    ORC->>WS: agent.proposal x6
    WS-->>FE: agent.proposal x6
    ORC->>CRD: reconcile(all proposals)
    CRD->>CRD: Rank + score plans
    CRD-->>ORC: RankedPlan[]
    loop For each plan
        ORC->>ADV: attack(plan)
        ADV-->>ORC: AdversaryFinding[]
    end
    ORC->>ORC: Merge adversary ratings
    ORC->>WS: plan.ranked
    WS-->>FE: plan.ranked

    Note over FE: Director approves plan
    FE->>ORC: POST /api/plans/id/approve
    ORC->>SIM: simulate(approved_plan, world)
    SIM-->>ORC: SimulationResult (valid)
    ORC->>WM: apply(approved_plan)
    WM->>DB: Persist updated world state
    ORC->>DB: Write audit log
    ORC->>WS: plan.accepted
    WS-->>FE: plan.accepted + world.update
